      "lines": [
        "475. 解方程：",
        "а) $\\sqrt{x}=5$； б) $\\sqrt[3]{x}=-0.5$； в) $\\sqrt[4]{x}=-2$；",
        "г) $\\sqrt[7]{x}=0$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "476",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "476. 解下列方程和不等式：",
        "а) $\\sqrt[3]{x}=5$； $\\sqrt[3]{x}>5$； $\\sqrt[3]{x}<5$；",
        "б) $\\sqrt[4]{x}=2$； $\\sqrt[4]{x}>2$； $\\sqrt[4]{x}<2$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "复习题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "477",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "477. 证明：当变量取正数值时，下列不等式是真不等式：",
        "а) $x^4+y^4\\geqslant x^3y+xy^3$； б) $a^4+1\\geqslant a^3+a$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "26. $n$ 次算术根的性质"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们知道算术平方根具有下列性质："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果 $a\\geqslant0$，$b\\geqslant0$，那么 $\\sqrt{ab}=\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b}$；"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果 $a\\geqslant0$，$b>0$，那么 $\\sqrt{\\frac{a}{b}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{b}}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$n$ 次算术根（当 $n>2$ 时）具有类似的性质。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "定理 $1$ **如果 $a\\geqslant0$，$b\\geqslant0$，那么 $\\sqrt[n]{ab}=\\sqrt[n]{a}\\cdot\\sqrt[n]{b}$。**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "定理 $2$ **如果 $a\\geqslant0$，$b>0$，那么 $\\sqrt[n]{\\frac{a}{b}}=\\frac{\\sqrt[n]{a}}{\\sqrt[n]{b}}$。**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们来证明定理 $1$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "式 $\\sqrt[n]{a}\\cdot\\sqrt[n]{b}$ 的值是非负数，因为当 $a\\geqslant0$ 和 $b\\geqslant0$ 时，其",
        "中每一个式子都有意义并且取非负值。此外，积 $\\sqrt[n]{a}\\cdot\\sqrt[n]{b}$",
        "的 $n$ 次幂等于 $ab$，就是："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "152"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
